  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC PHASE-OUT MANAGEMENT PLAN (STAGE I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to address the phase-out of HCFCs in St. Vincent and the Grenadines following the accelerated phase-out agreement in accordance with the Montreal Protocol. This will allow St. Vincent and the Grenadines to effectively rid itself of the consumption of HCFCs by the year 2020; a feat when accomplished allows the pase-out ten years ahead of the schedule as outlined in the Montreal Protocol decision XIX/6 of the Meeting of the Parties.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Protocol</narrative>
  </participating-org>
